  "longBusinessSummary": "Igarashi Motors India Limited manufactures and sells electric micro motors and motor components in India, the United States, Japan, Germany, Hong Kong, and internationally. The company operates through two segments, Automotive and Non-Automotive. Its products include ceiling fans; and electrical equipment, general purpose, and special purpose machinery and equipment. The company also offers engine air management, electric parking brake, park lock and gear box actuators, anti-lock braking systems, seat motors, trunk opening and closing devices, BLDC motors, sub-assemblies, and electronic system design and manufacturing products. The company was formerly known as CG Igarashi Motors Limited and changed its name to Igarashi Motors India Limited in July 2003. The company was incorporated in 1992 and is based in Chennai, India. Igarashi Motors India Limited operates as a subsidiary of Agile Electric Sub Assembly Private Limited.",
